--- !u!114 &567211741
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 567211739}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> npc.SetMode(NavigationMode)
    / SetFollowTarget / SetCombinedTarget / SetDestination / RefreshPath / SetRunning
    / Stop / Resume; IsChasing, IsRunning, Mode; events onModeChanged, onStartFollowing
    / onStopFollowing, onPatrolPointReached, onMovementStarted / Stopped.\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select 'NPC Chaser', 'NPC Guard' or '[Demo] World/NPC
    Patroller | NPC Sentry' to see NpcNavigation + NavMeshAgent. Their events call
    '[Demo] Services/Demo Controller'; the Sentry's onStartFollowing also turns on
    its red 'Alert' (GameObject.SetActive, NoCode).\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Play: Chaser and Guard path around the yellow walls; Run
    raises the Chaser's speed and Stop freezes it; the Guard changes mode from the
    card; the Sentry's alert lights while it chases. Stagger Path Updates spreads
    the NPCs' re-paths over the 0.5 s interval.\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color>  Walk
    / Run, Stop / Resume -> NpcNavigation directly (NoCode)\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color> 
    Follow / Patrol / Combined -> NpcDemoController.SetGuardMode -> guard.SetMode\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color> 
    Sentry onStartFollowing -> Alert.SetActive(true) + log\n<color=#59D98C>\xBB</color> 
    Orbit speed slider -> ConstantRotator.SetDegreesPerSecond"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
